{"1779750":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"The House Before","steam_appid":1779750,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up as a House.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your limbs stretch through endless rooms filled with grotesque creatures. You can never see outside of yourself, never feel the world that lies beyond your flesh.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner of your anatomy is seething with terror. Every inch of your skin is painted with intricate wounds, etched long before you were born. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yet, there is life inside you: shapeless haunts, organic material with barely any purpose, save to despise you for crimes committed aeons ago. <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY: <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The House Before is an interactive horror story about the wreckages of history and the terror of being trapped inside one's own body.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends elements of visual novels and adventure with simple  mini-games.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The House Before takes around 2 hours to complete and is mostly a linear experience.  You will enjoy it if you are looking for an original story and a poetic horror atmosphere.  It probably won’t be for you if you’re looking for a fast-paced action experience, jump scares or complex puzzles.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your guts.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1779750\/extras\/f7245ac4add25be904c3e4a3d9e1dbf2.poster.avif?t=1793707714\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1779750